// KEYS.W3
//
// This file contains all the keyboard shortcuts for WARLORDS III
// CTRL+s is reserved for Screen Shots
// (Note: This header must always be 5 lines long)
TAB			- Next Group
ENTER		- Leave & Select Next
INSERT		- Defend Group
END			- Move this Group
a			- Move All Groups
ESCAPE		- Deselect
SPACE		- Group / Ungroup All
CTRL+E		- End Turn
0 (ZERO)	- Centre on Group
HOME		- Centre on Capitol
LEFT		- Scroll Map Left
RIGHT		- Scroll Map Right
UP			- Scroll Map Up
DOWN		- Scroll Map Down
NONE		- Page Map Left
NONE		- Page Map Right
NONE		- Page Map Up
NONE		- Page Map Down
NONE		- Fight Ordering
BACKSPACE	- Disband Group
DELETE		- Cancel Move Path
s			- Stack Dialog
r			- Raze City / Site
V			- Vector Group
z			- Search Ruin
Q			- Get Quest
h			- Hero Report
H			- Hero Deeds
L			- Hero Levels
S			- View Spells
I			- Sell Items
q			- Show Quest
A			- Army Report
C			- City Report
D			- Diplomacy Report
E			- Event Report
G			- Gold Report
K			- Kills Report
M			- Mana Report
P			- Production Report
R			- Ruins Report
Z			- Sites Report
S			- Spells Report
W			- Winners Report
/			- About Scenario
NONE		- Army Lists
NONE		- Hero Lists
NONE		- Item Lists
NONE		- Campaign Briefing
NONE		- Campaign Intro
NONE		- Scenario Intro
F1			- Help
F3			- Chat Mode
F4			- View Options
F5			- Set Preferences
CTRL+G		- Resign
?			- About Warlords III
NONE		- Save Game
F2			- Fast Save
CTRL+L		- Load Game
CTRL+N		- New Game
CTRL+Q		- Quit		
NONE		- EMail Statistics
p			- Production
v			- Vectoring
b			- Build City / Site
CTRL+P		- Ability Points
CTRL+O		- Side Lists
F8			- Chat Bar
CTRL+V		- Easy Vectoring
CTRL+X		- Minimize
CTRL+U		- Undo Movement
CTRL+C		- Clean Up Armies/Cities

